From bb4a21eba7e41e6723f386d3790b3db04f1f0f54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Chong <achong@meta.com>
Date: Mon, 4 Aug 2025 09:37:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 01/11] remove soong bootstrap tests that don't work on macos

Summary:
# Motivation:
These tests fail to run on darwin and block the build process.
# Overview:
- remove tests that don't work on darwin

This branch cut is for darwin host tools only. So it's acceptable

Test Plan:
```
. build/envsetup.sh
 lunch aosp_cf_arm64_phone-userdebug
 m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz -k &> ~/build.logs.txt
```

Rollback Plan:

Reviewers: tcare, #cuttlefish-cross-platform, benthomas

Reviewed By: tcare

Subscribers: ilyatsunaev, jmgao, ryanyu, #wearables_emulators

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.intern.facebook.com/D79566948

Tags: aarch64
